\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate <strong>goal</strong>: achieve <strong>financial freedom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get there, you\u2019ll need <strong>professionalism</strong>, <strong>patience</strong>, and <strong>courage</strong>. Every job hides a <strong>mysterious</strong> story, which you\u2019ll have to dare to discover\u2026 sometimes even against your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job at Risk</strong> is waiting for you. Are you ready to take on the <strong>adventure</strong>?</p>","developers":["Cryptic Dog Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251270/08ea177ebb0cde576113d3b68a4ef7b7c57279b9/header.jpg?t=1765747949","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2251270/1821947087/0e5cc18ed482ebb50bee40e4a1f9882304731906/1754431937/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754433781","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2251270/1821947087/0e5cc18ed482ebb50bee40e4a1f9882304731906/1754431937/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754433781","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2251270/1821947087/0e5cc18ed482ebb50bee40e4a1f9882304731906/1754431937/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754433781","id":257178779,"name":"Trailer (Outdated)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178779/df6e178ab19614f0ec9289dc515a9eff7885cc28/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754433781"}],"na